  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of TBST specificity (%) in BCG-vaccinated individuals with negative IGRA results from three studies: Xu 2021 (C-TST vs T-SPOT.TB) 97.44%, Starshinova 2018 (DST 5mm vs QFT) 99.06% and Aggerbeck 2013 (C-Tb vs QFT) 99.32%. The random-effects pooled specificity is 98.97% (96.86–99.67) across 292 participants.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنوعية اختبارات TBST (%) لدى الأفراد الملقَّحين بلقاح BCG ذوي نتائج IGRA السلبية من ثلاث دراسات: Xu 2021 (C-TST مقابل T-SPOT.TB) 97.44%، وStarshinova 2018 (DST 5 مم مقابل QFT) 99.06%، وAggerbeck 2013 (C-Tb مقابل QFT) 99.32%. وتبلغ النوعية المجمّعة بنموذج التأثيرات العشوائية 98.97% (96.86–99.67) لدى 292 مشاركاً.",
      "lang": "ar",
